+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The ``delay_since_first_attempt`` key is now present in ``statistics`` from the
+    start of each run, with the value ``0`` until a delay has occurred. Previously it
+    was missing during the first attempt, so reading it there raised ``KeyError``.
